  "question": {
    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi></math> be a non-negative function in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>]</mo></math> and twice differentiable in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>.</mo></math>&nbsp;If&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>x</mi></msubsup><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mo>(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>dt</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>x</mi></msubsup><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mo>)</mo><mi>dt</mi><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8804;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>1</mn></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></munder><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>x</mi></msubsup><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mo>)</mo><mi>dt</mi><mo>:</mo></math>"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "does not exist",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "equals <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
